[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954395474","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107291#issuecomment-2954395474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107291","id":2954395474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wGH9S","user":{"login":"llama-nl","id":94882246,"node_id":"U_kgDOBafJxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94882246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl","html_url":"https://github.com/llama-nl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T01:06:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T01:06:38Z","body":"Have you tried debuging your game using [Profiler](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/debug/the_profiler.html) to see what causing most frame in Compatibility Renderer.\n\nAlso importantly upload a MRP so that other can test it.\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954395474/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955108506","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107291#issuecomment-2955108506","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107291","id":2955108506,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wI2Ca","user":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T08:48:01Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T08:48:01Z","body":"Sorry, I don't think there is anything we can do about it:\n- You are comparing codebases that are years apart, with different renderers, and with different choices made regarding what was optimized or not (performance might suffer if we want to keep more device compatible, things like that). As a consequence, there's absolutely no reason the TileMap code is at fault here.\n- The Godot 4 TileMap is a lot more powerful than the Godot 3 one, we never claimed the performance would be exactly the same.\n- We do not plan to optimize games from 1000 FPS to 2000 FPS, this is a meaningless improvement. Something more meaningful, for example, was if a real game turned from 250 to 30 FPS, as such a difference actually impacts the user experience.\n\nSo well, if this is a real issue you have with your game, please upload an MRP.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955108506/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955251685","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107291#issuecomment-2955251685","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107291","id":2955251685,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wJY_l","user":{"login":"sametcnlkr","id":62812513,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyODEyNTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62812513?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr","html_url":"https://github.com/sametcnlkr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T09:39:47Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T09:39:47Z","body":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b83795ff-4dea-4fd2-87a3-2e60357ab14a\n\n**All codes for Godot 4 and Godot 3 (some different code names for Godot 3):**\n```\nCamera2D:\n    extends Camera2D\n\n    func _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tvar dir:Vector2 = Input.get_vector(\"A\", \"D\", \"W\", \"S\")\n\tposition += dir * 1250.0 * delta\n\nTileMapLayer:\n    extends TileMapLayer\n    @onready var label: Label = $CanvasLayer/Label\n\n    func _ready() -> void:\n\tfor x:int in 200:\n\t\tfor y:int in 200:\n\t\t\tset_cell(Vector2i(x, y), randi() % 3, Vector2i(0, 0))\n\n    func _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tlabel.text = str(Engine.get_frames_per_second())\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955251685/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955286708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107291#issuecomment-2955286708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107291","id":2955286708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wJhi0","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T09:53:46Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T09:53:46Z","body":"This is not a MRP. A MRP stands for Minimal Reproducible Project.\n\nAlso known as: put the code in a project that bug triagers can run","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955286708/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955482270","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107291#issuecomment-2955482270","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107291","id":2955482270,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wKRSe","user":{"login":"sametcnlkr","id":62812513,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyODEyNTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62812513?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr","html_url":"https://github.com/sametcnlkr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T11:12:41Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T11:13:04Z","body":"I'm sorry, I accidentally pressed completed button.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955482270/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955492839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107291#issuecomment-2955492839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107291","id":2955492839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wKT3n","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T11:17:35Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T11:24:56Z","body":"Please note also that there's no general guarantee that Godot 4 will run faster on any specific hardware than Godot 3 does, especially with the compatibility renderer, Godot 4 is has higher requirements and is more powerful, but that comes at a higher cost. The Forward+ and Mobile renderers are often faster at a lot of tasks because it leverages a lot of optimizations and improvements that Vulkan offers, but it depends on a lot of factors\n\nA far more appropriate comparison would be between Forward+ and Godot 3","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955492839/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955519869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107291#issuecomment-2955519869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107291","id":2955519869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wKad9","user":{"login":"sametcnlkr","id":62812513,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyODEyNTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62812513?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr","html_url":"https://github.com/sametcnlkr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sametcnlkr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T11:29:50Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T11:29:50Z","body":"I absolutely agree with you, especially SpriteBatch optimizations in Vulkan are much better. But I like to use OpenGL because graphics cards from 2011 or earlier don't support Vulkan (these graphics cards are capable of playing most of today's games and I can't ignore them just because of Vulkan).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955519869/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955548693","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107291#issuecomment-2955548693","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107291","id":2955548693,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wKhgV","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T11:43:20Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T11:43:20Z","body":"If there are some areas where performance is bad due to a bug that's something to investigate (which is why we need an MRP), but depending on the project it's not always possible to run it on very old hardware (I'd say running Godot 4 on hardware that's over 14 years old is not necessarily expected to go well), where compatibility with *very* old hardware is needed I'd recommend using Godot 3 if it works well\n\nSo we should fix clear performance *issues* but Godot 4 isn't necessarily going to be compatible with very old hardware, like any game or software. Developers should also consider changes to their games to accommodate older hardware, like reducing the size of the game area or other simplifications, developer optimizations are an important part of development, and not something the engine itself can fix in every case (which is why the profiler is a very powerful tool!)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955548693/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2957921611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107291#issuecomment-2957921611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107291","id":2957921611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wTk1L","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T07:07:34Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T07:07:34Z","body":"The 2D backends in Godot 3 and 4 are very different, even in the compatibility renderer. It is likely that Godot 3 beats 4 in some areas (maybe raw batching performance in simple scenarios), and 4 beats 3 in others (probably once lighting gets involved, that can quite easily cripple Godot 3). It's fairly easy to construct benchmarks where 3 whoops 4, and vice versa.\n\nI spent months adding optimizations to Godot 3 batching renderer to try and make the best of the input it gets, and likely some of these are not in Godot 4 (there are more backends to support, and there is no common batching layer afaik, so everything has to be rewritten for each backend).\n\nSome things that are in Godot 3 that may not be in 4:\n* `MultiRect` (speeds up tilemap and text particularly)\n* Overlap based re-ordering\n* 2D hierarchical culling (try testing when a large part of your map is off screen in 3 and 4)\n\nSo if 4 looks slow at something, it's likely just because 3 is really good at it 😎 , rather than a bug in 4.\n\n_The one thing I never got around to in 3.x was the reliance on buffer orphaning, but it's less pressing to address at this stage._","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2957921611/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]